{"route":"/featured-work/sooraj-candy-shop","title":"Kingdom of Sweets | Featured Work | NicheUX","head":["<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"google9b1d4245b2b7f92d\" data-rh=\"true\">","<meta name=\"description\" content=\"A personal memory piece for Sooraj Nikam. An arch banner designed from a notes app sketch, to go on a miniature toy shop that holds chocolates for visitors.\" data-rh=\"true\">","<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kingdom of Sweets. Sooraj Nikam × NicheUX\" data-rh=\"true\">","<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A tribute to a place that mattered. Designed from a hand-drawn sketch, made into a banner for a toy-sized merch full of chocolates.\" data-rh=\"true\">"],"body":"<div class=\"App\"><a href=\"#main-content\" style=\"position: absolute; left: -9999px; top: auto; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;\">Skip to main content</a><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Studio announcements\" style=\"background: rgb(235, 199, 115); position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; overflow: hidden; z-index: 1002; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; transition: background 0.4s;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(12px, 4vw, 40px); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: clamp(8px, 2vw, 20px);\"><style>.strip-short{display:none}@media (max-width:640px){.strip-long{display:none}.strip-short{display:inline}.strip-dots,.strip-label{display:none!important}}</style><a href=\"/contact?selection=Free%20Website%20Check%20%28send%20your%20link%29&amp;hint=My%20website%20link%20is%3A%20\" data-discover=\"true\" style=\"align-self: stretch; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: clamp(8px, 2vw, 16px); flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; opacity: 1; transition: opacity 0.2s;\"><span class=\"strip-label\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); flex-shrink: 0;\">Free Check</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"strip-label\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 12px; background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.25); flex-shrink: 0;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Cormorant Garamond&quot;, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(13px, 1.2vw, 15px); color: rgb(10, 10, 10); flex: 1 1 0%; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\"><span class=\"strip-long\">Send us your website link and we reply within 24 hours with 3 fixes</span><span class=\"strip-short\">Free website check in 24h</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.4); padding-bottom: 1px; white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0;\">Send a link →</span></a><div class=\"strip-dots\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;\"><button style=\"background: none; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; cursor: pointer; color: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.45); width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\"><button aria-label=\"Announcement 1\" class=\"pagination-dot-tiny\" style=\"background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.65); transition: background 0.3s;\"></button><button aria-label=\"Announcement 2\" class=\"pagination-dot-tiny\" style=\"background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.28); transition: background 0.3s;\"></button><button aria-label=\"Announcemen